{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:12:05",
      "utterance": "おはようございます。よろしくお願いします。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:23:11",
      "utterance": "このままお待ちしていれば大丈夫でしょうか…？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:25:37",
      "utterance": "開始の合図があるかと思いますので、もう少しお待ちくださいませ。",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:26:00",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。承知しました。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:26:34",
      "utterance": "私はカウンセラー部門でのエントリーとなっていますので、よろしくお願いいたします。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:58:17",
      "utterance": "改めまして、おはようございます。テーマ「恋愛」（カウンセリング）11時30分終了予定となります。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:58:56",
      "utterance": "それでは、ここからロールプレイお願い致します。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:59:09",
      "utterance": "よろしくお願いいたします。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:59:26",
      "utterance": "こんにちは、相談員です。はじめに、年齢と性別を教えていただいても大丈夫でしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T10:59:39",
      "utterance": "20歳女性です。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:00:04",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。今日は、どのようなご相談でしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:00:14",
      "utterance": "恋愛のことで…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:00:31",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:00:43",
      "utterance": "お力になりたいと思いますので、",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:01:06",
      "utterance": "お話できる範囲で大丈夫なので、詳しくお聴きできますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:01:12",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:01:33",
      "utterance": "実は…彼がいるんですけど、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:01:45",
      "utterance": "ええ（続けてくださいね）",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:01:52",
      "utterance": "違う人を好きになってしまって…悩んでます。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:02:07",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:02:16",
      "utterance": "それは悩んでしまいますよね…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:02:28",
      "utterance": "はい。どうしたらいいか…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:02:59",
      "utterance": "どうしたら…と思いますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:03:18",
      "utterance": "ひどい話ですよね(泣)",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:03:19",
      "utterance": "一緒に考えていきたいと思いますよ。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:03:26",
      "utterance": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:03:43",
      "utterance": "ご自身を責めてしまう気持ちも、おありなんですね…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:03:54",
      "utterance": "それも、苦しいですよね…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:04:06",
      "utterance": "そうですね。今の彼とは一応将来のことも話していたので",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:04:19",
      "utterance": "うん、うん。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:04:38",
      "utterance": "ただ、気持ちに歯止めが効かなくて辛いです。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:05:08",
      "utterance": "ええ。そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:05:12",
      "utterance": "気持ちって、自分ではどうにもならない時もありますよね…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:05:21",
      "utterance": "はい…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:06:00",
      "utterance": "あなたとしては…今後はどうなっていければ、気持ちが楽になりそうでしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:06:24",
      "utterance": "今の彼とは別れようかと考えてしまっています。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:06:33",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:06:49",
      "utterance": "新しい彼と、今後は過ごしていきたい感じ？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:07:11",
      "utterance": "それも不安なんですけど…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:07:20",
      "utterance": "うん、うん。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:07:24",
      "utterance": "新しい彼からは告白されたばかりで。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:07:34",
      "utterance": "そっか、そうだったんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:08:05",
      "utterance": "多分、今の彼のこと、心から好きではなくなっていたのかな。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:08:25",
      "utterance": "うん、うん。そのような感じもあるのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:08:40",
      "utterance": "だから、違う人を好きになってしまったのかな、と思います。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:09:02",
      "utterance": "そうなんだね。そのような気持ちになることもあると思いますよ。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:09:23",
      "utterance": "そうでしょうか。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:09:36",
      "utterance": "私はひどい女だなーとか思います。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:09:59",
      "utterance": "そのように感じているんですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:10:16",
      "utterance": "なんとなく、そう感じてしまってます。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:11:08",
      "utterance": "ずっと付き合ってきたから、",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:11:34",
      "utterance": "他の人と急に…というのは気が引けるような気持ちもありますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:11:43",
      "utterance": "でも、",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:11:55",
      "utterance": "気持ちって、本当に複雑だから…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:09",
      "utterance": "そこが、難しいところだし、",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:16",
      "utterance": "苦しくもなりますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:21",
      "utterance": "はい…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:33",
      "utterance": "今は…二人とは、どのような関係なんですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:51",
      "utterance": "えっと、二人とは？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:12:56",
      "utterance": "彼ですか？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:08",
      "utterance": "今の彼と新しい人？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:10",
      "utterance": "はい。今までの彼と、新しい彼と、",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:18",
      "utterance": "すみません！",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:23",
      "utterance": "今は、どんな関係なのかな？って。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:43",
      "utterance": "謝らないで、大丈夫ですよ。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:13:48",
      "utterance": "今の彼とは2年くらいになりますが、なんとなくなーなーです。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:14:02",
      "utterance": "一緒に、上京して来たけど、",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:14:11",
      "utterance": "うん、うん。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:14:18",
      "utterance": "仕事も直ぐに辞めてしまって…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:14:45",
      "utterance": "結婚の話もしてましたが、この先不安です。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:14:55",
      "utterance": "そうなんだね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:15:07",
      "utterance": "同居もされていたのかな？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:15:44",
      "utterance": "私は学生で彼は社会人なので、彼のアパートには行ったりします。同居はしてません。新しい彼とはまだ出会ったばかりです。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:15:55",
      "utterance": "なるほどですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:16:23",
      "utterance": "このまま結婚するのは…と思ってはいました。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:16:42",
      "utterance": "学生さんだと、将来のこともいろいろ考えますものね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:16:53",
      "utterance": "いろいろなこと、不安になりますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:17:03",
      "utterance": "はい。彼とは温度差はありますね…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:17:31",
      "utterance": "そっか。温度差も…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:18:02",
      "utterance": "今の段階から食い違いがあると、",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:18:29",
      "utterance": "将来のことを考えると、",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:18:48",
      "utterance": "抵抗も出てくることも、もっともですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:19:06",
      "utterance": "そのような中で、新しい彼と出会った？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:19:43",
      "utterance": "そうです？",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:19:56",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:20:14",
      "utterance": "新しい彼とは、どのような出会いでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:20:50",
      "utterance": "バイト先の友達の友達で、みんなで遊びに行き出会いました。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:21:20",
      "utterance": "うん、うん。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:22:32",
      "utterance": "最初、一緒に遊んでみてどうでしたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:23:15",
      "utterance": "寒いといったら上着をかけてくれたり、男らしくてトキメキましたm(_ _)m",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:23:23",
      "utterance": "おお…！",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:23:36",
      "utterance": "紳士な感じ。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:23:49",
      "utterance": "心温まりますね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:24:18",
      "utterance": "嬉しかったです。年も同じだから何となく楽というか。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:24:32",
      "utterance": "そっか、そっか。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:24:47",
      "utterance": "でも、まだお付き合いはしてません。彼がいるから。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:25:13",
      "utterance": "そうゆうことだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:25:20",
      "utterance": "はい。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:25:28",
      "utterance": "教えてくれて、ありがとうです。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:25:34",
      "utterance": "いえいえ",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:25:56",
      "utterance": "どうしよう…ってなってます。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:26:12",
      "utterance": "アドバイスいただけたらと。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:26:14",
      "utterance": "ええ、迷いますよね…",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:26:43",
      "utterance": "しっかりとお力になりたいと思うのですが、その前に、",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:26:58",
      "utterance": "もう一つ、聞かせてほしくて。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:27:01",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:27:31",
      "utterance": "新しい彼とは、どのくらいの付き合いになりますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-12-31T11:27:46",
      "utterance": "まだ、知り合ったばかりです。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
